						<UML:TaggedValue tag="documentation" value="The setpoint of the temperature&#xA;control valve shall be checked&#xA;against the main engine&#xA;manufacturer&#x27;s technical data. The&#xA;high-temperature cooling water&#xA;engine outlet temperature setpoint&#xA;shall be 79°C nominal, and the&#xA;mechanical thermostatic element&#xA;adjustment range shall be 77-85°C.&#xA;Criterion: 79°C nominal; mechanical&#xA;thermostatic element range 77-85°C&#xA;Grade: B&#xA;Derivation: Direct&#xA;Route: ENGINEER_CONFIRM --- cites manufacturer/operational&#xA;guidance only (tier-b)&#xA;Verification: Inspection&#xA;Cited: E-LT-COMP-006"/>
