						<UML:TaggedValue tag="ea_localid" value="43"/>
						<UML:TaggedValue tag="ea_eleType" value="element"/>
						<UML:TaggedValue tag="documentation" value="The installation position of the&#xA;temperature control valve shall be&#xA;checked against the main engine&#xA;manufacturer&#x27;s requirements. When&#xA;multiple engines share a combined&#xA;low-temperature cooling water&#xA;system, an external temperature&#xA;controller shall be used. The&#xA;external controller shall be&#xA;installed at the engine control&#xA;room console and wired to the&#xA;temperature control valve.&#xA;Criterion: {{TBD|unit:none|ref:S41 Everllence&#xA;49/60DF Project&#xA;Guide|component:Low-temperature&#xA;cooling water temperature control&#xA;valve|intent:Installation&#xA;position|hint:External temperature&#xA;controller installed at the engine&#xA;control room console and wired to&#xA;the temperature control valve}}&#xA;Grade: C&#xA;Derivation: Deferred&#xA;Route: OPEN_ITEM --- value deferred to named source&#xA;document&#xA;Verification: Inspection&#xA;Cited: E-TCV-TEMP-055"/>
