						<UML:TaggedValue tag="ea_eleType" value="element"/>
						<UML:TaggedValue tag="documentation" value="The setpoint and installation&#xA;position of the temperature&#xA;control valve shall be checked&#xA;against the main engine&#xA;manufacturer&#x27;s technical data or&#xA;project calculation documents. The&#xA;parameter confirmation path shall&#xA;follow the minimum temperature&#xA;control method of the cooling&#xA;system thermostatic control (inlet&#xA;control or outlet control), and&#xA;the maximum temperature shall be&#xA;controlled by correct sizing of&#xA;the radiator, heat exchanger, or&#xA;similar equipment.&#xA;Criterion: {{TBD|unit:none|ref:S21&#xA;Caterpillar Cooling Systems&#xA;Application and Installation&#xA;Guide|component:Temperature&#xA;control valve|intent:Setpoint and&#xA;installation position confirmation&#xA;path|hint:Determined based on the&#xA;main engine manufacturer&#x27;s&#xA;technical data or project&#xA;calculation documents,&#xA;distinguishing between inlet&#xA;control and outlet control&#xA;methods}}&#xA;Grade: C&#xA;Derivation: Deferred&#xA;Route: OPEN_ITEM --- value deferred to named source&#xA;document&#xA;Verification: Analysis&#xA;Cited: E-SYS-PRESS-006"/>
